13.875197                alpha1      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA>alpha0. (deg)
-12.723069               alpha2      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA<alpha0. (deg)
